{"id": "EUVD-2026-102297", "enisaUuid": "94d8893c-091d-3e12-a91f-bce6b4724dad", "description": "kedro-datasets from 9.3.0 through 9.6.0 contains a path traversal vulnerability in MatplotlibDataset.save() that allows attackers to write files outside the dataset directory by supplying absolute plot names. Because validate_sub_path() strips leading slashes while pathlib's join discards the base path, attackers can create or overwrite files anywhere the process can write.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T18:57:55", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T01:30:43", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/kedro-org/kedro-plugins/pull/1544", "https://github.com/kedro-org/kedro-plugins/blob/611ce7a20dcb0be655190afb9064468fa278b08c/kedro-datasets/kedro_datasets/matplotlib/matplotlib_dataset.py#L198-L201", "https://github.com/kedro-org/kedro-plugins/blob/611ce7a20dcb0be655190afb9064468fa278b08c/kedro-datasets/kedro_datasets/_utils/security.py#L22", "https://github.com/kedro-org/kedro-plugins/security/advisories/GHSA-cjg8-h5qc-hrjv", "https://github.com/kedro-org/kedro-plugins", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/kedro-datasets-9.3.0-through-9.6.0-path-traversal-via-matplotlibdataset-plot-name"], "aliases": ["GHSA-7vr2-8p3f-2p48", "CVE-2026-111170"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.39, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "39efd7fa-3c65-3663-b15a-fcd36711b8ba", "product": {"name": "kedro-datasets", "vendor": {"name": "kedro-org"}}, "product_version": "9.3.0 \u22649.6.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4d584335-3238-36b6-9947-55fe664cd642", "vendor": {"name": "kedro-org"}}], "isExploited": false}